OL,3,GNEWSARare coral fungus discovered at
OL,4,Awildlife park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare fungus once thought extinct in
OL,7,FBritain has been discovered at a
OL,8,Fwildlife park in Kent.
OL,10,FThe crown-tipped coral fungus was
OL,11,Fspotted growing on a fallen log at
OL,12,FWildwood Trust near Canterbury by a
OL,13,Fkeeper near the rabbit enclosure.
OL,15,FAlso known as candelabra coral, the
OL,16,Ffungus went 116 years without a
OL,17,Fconfirmed sighting before being
OL,18,Frediscovered in Suffolk in 2012,
OL,19,Fheritage officer Steve Kirk said.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
