OL,3,GNEWSARare coral fungus discovered at
OL,4,Awildlife park
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the fungus was still rarely
OL,7,Frecorded in Britain, but there had been
OL,8,Fmore sightings in recent years, and it
OL,9,Fwas possible that warmer summers could
OL,10,Fbe helping the species spread.
